{"3716000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Detective Bureau", "steam_appid": 3716000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/68c35ce39461eea8875686da6f714971.avif?t=1785734141\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You're a detective working the phones. A folder of notes, a desk, and a city full of secrets. Solve intricate cases by speaking directly to the people involved, and hear them respond, unscripted, through real-time generative AI. Each conversation is different, shaped by what you say and how you say it. Your job is to uncover the truth, one unpredictable exchange at a time  and close the case by submitting a final report identifying the guilty party, their motives, and their means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🗂️ <strong>Analyze case files, connect the dots, and piece together your theory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your case file to study the evidence and learn about the people involved. Apply sharp deduction to figure out who did it, why they did it, and how it all happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/ab1057347943ec02e597ca88ca0bbc57.poster.avif?t=1785734141\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/ab1057347943ec02e597ca88ca0bbc57.webm?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/ab1057347943ec02e597ca88ca0bbc57.mp4?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">📞 <strong>Pick up the phone, ask your questions, and follow your instincts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every voice call is dynamic. No repeated dialogue. No decision trees. Just you and whoever’s on the other end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/11fed5ab7ca406489c52ae96c6f9396b.poster.avif?t=1785734141\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/11fed5ab7ca406489c52ae96c6f9396b.webm?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/11fed5ab7ca406489c52ae96c6f9396b.mp4?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">📝 <strong>Every clue matters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Examine the evidence, link the details, and use what you uncover to expose the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/9a321b8b4dcc7e1eb54890396531332c.poster.avif?t=1785734141\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/9a321b8b4dcc7e1eb54890396531332c.webm?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/9a321b8b4dcc7e1eb54890396531332c.mp4?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🧠 <strong>When you’re ready, file your final report.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Identify the guilty party, submit your conclusion, and see if you were right. There are no take-backs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/9cb9bb7a8c143743d6d90103f7ef6134.poster.avif?t=1785734141\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/9cb9bb7a8c143743d6d90103f7ef6134.webm?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/9cb9bb7a8c143743d6d90103f7ef6134.mp4?t=1785734141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your conversations shape the outcome. Every case is its own mystery, and every answer is up to you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716000/extras/68c35ce39461eea8875686da6f714971.avif?t=1785734141\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You're a detective working the phones. A folder of notes, a desk, and a city full of secrets. Solve intricate cases by speaking directly to the people involved, and hear them respond, unscripted, through real-time generative AI. Each conversation is different,